// critical_emergency.med
// MedRoute Example 1 — Full single-patient critical dispatch
// ============================================================
// Demonstrates the complete compilation pipeline:
// Patient registration → Dispatch → Arrival → Transfer

// Register emergency patient
PATIENT P101
LOCATION P101 "Sardar Patel Road"
SEVERITY P101 CRITICAL

// Register resources
AMBULANCE A12
HOSPITAL H01 "City Hospital"

// Dispatch and route
DISPATCH A12 P101
ROUTE A12 H01
PRIORITY A12 HIGH

// Check current status
STATUS A12

// Simulate arrival and patient handover
ARRIVE A12
TRANSFER P101 H01

// Print final system state
STATUS A12
REPORT
